<title>USA: Martin Marietta Materials buys Nuckolls.</title>
<headline>Martin Marietta Materials buys Nuckolls.</headline>
<dateline>RALEIGH, N.C. 1997-05-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Martin Marietta Materials Inc said Wednesday it has bought Nuckolls Aggregates Inc for an undisclosed amount of cash.</p>
<p>Privately held Nuckolls operates one limestone quarry and six sand and gravel pits in north central Iowa, Martin Marietta said. Its annual capacity exceeds 1.2 million tons.</p>
<p>Martin Marietta is the nation's second largest producer of construction aggregates, it said.</p>
